#: thold_templates.php
msgid ""
"This is the message that will be displayed at the top of all Threshold "
"restoral notifications (1024 Chars MAX).  HTML is allowed, but will be "
"removed for text only Emails.  There are several common replacement tags "
"that may be used in include:<br>&#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 "
"&#060HOST_ID&#062 &#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 "
"&#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062  &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 "
"&#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 &#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062  &#060DSNAME&#062 "
"&#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 &#60NOTES&#62 &#060DNOTES&#062"
msgstr ""
"Meddelandet visas högst upp i alla aviseringar om återställda tröskelvärden "
"(högst 1 024 tecken). HTML tillåts men tas bort i e-postmeddelanden med "
"enbart text. Följande ersättningstaggar kan "
"användas:<br>&#060DESCRIPTION&#062 &#060HOSTNAME&#062 &#060HOST_ID&#062 "
"&#060TIME&#062 &#060DATE&#062 &#060DATE_RFC822&#062 &#060BREACHED_ITEMS&#062"
"  &#060URL&#062 &#060GRAPHID&#062 &#060CURRENTVALUE&#062 "
"&#060THRESHOLDNAME&#062  &#060DSNAME&#062 &#060SUBJECT&#062 &#060GRAPH&#062 "
"&#60NOTES&#62 &#060DNOTES&#062"
